- Moonshot model list (https://platform.kimi.ai/docs/models), pricing table (https://platform.kimi.ai/docs/pricing/chat), platform changelog and docs index (https://platform.kimi.ai/docs/llms.txt): K3, K2.7 Code, K2.7 Code HighSpeed, K2.6 only — **no K2.8 page or changelog entry**
- Hugging Face org `moonshotai` (20 repos): newest are Kimi-K3 (2026-06-13) and Kimi-K2.7-Code (2026-06-11) — **no K2.8**
- OpenCode Zen catalogue and `https://opencode.ai/inference/v1/models`: Kimi K2.5 / K2.6 / K2.7 Code / K3 only — **no K2.8**
- Kimi consumer surfaces (kimi.com, kimi.ai/code, membership pricing): no "K2.8" / "preview" string in page text

### Negative findings summary

- No verified public score found for Terminal-Bench, τ²/τ³, GDPval, GPQA, HLE, LCR/MLCR, CritPt, SWE-bench, LiveCodeBench, DeepSWE, SciCode, MMMU-Pro or any long-context retrieval test.
